            {
                "comment": "she really gets to know every student and always makes herself available for questions and meetings. i found comm a boring but i did improve my writing a lot with andrea's help. she is great!",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Andrea is an absolutely awesome professor. She really goes the extra mile to get to know her students personally. I feel completely comfortable talking to her and emailing her whenever I need anything. 11/10 would take any class with her again. ",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "She truly enjoys what she does and it shows in her teaching. She's always ready to give feedback and talk about what was good/bad, and if it is bad she words it in a very nice way! She really cares about her students and it's refreshing. Definitely one of my favorite classes to go to!",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
